      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "DE435AC74FC0C3A9",
      "text": "Que se passe-t-il ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "5772ABE9CF9E01E9",
      "text": "Je suis désolé d’interrompre ta Chasse au Trésor,\\nmais j’ai une bonne nouvelle à t’annoncer.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "5772AAE9CF9E0036",
      "text": "Tous les ans à cette période, l’académie organise\\nun voyage scolaire en collaboration avec\\r\\nun autre établissement...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "5772ADE9CF9E054F",
      "text": "Eh bien, crois-le ou non, tu as été sélectionné[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\npour y participer ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "5772AFE9CF9E08B5",
      "text": "Le voyage scolaire va se dérouler à [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Septentria[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\nune contrée lointaine située à l’est d’ici ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "5772AEE9CF9E0702",
      "text": "Comme le voyage est long, nous n’avons\\nsélectionné qu’une poignée d’élèves.\\c\\nTu te rends compte de la chance que tu as\\nd’en faire partie ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "5772B1E9CF9E0C1B",
      "text": "Je t’invite à te rendre dans le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]hall d’entrée[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nde l’académie pour en savoir plus.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0000_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "5772B0E9CF9E0A68",
      "text": "Bien entendu, rien ne t’oblige à y aller, mais\\ncette occasion ne se représentera peut-être pas.\\c\\nAlors, si tu es curieu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]xse, je te conseille vivement\\nd’y prendre part ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
